1
00:00:09,049 --> 00:00:13,569
Do you really know what is running on your production floor, right now?

2
00:00:14,569 --> 00:00:18,993
In most garment units, each operation is written on paper,

3
00:00:19,213 --> 00:00:22,817
or typed into Odoo hours later by a supervisor.

4
00:00:23,037 --> 00:00:26,292
Entries come late, wrong, or not at all.

5
00:00:27,292 --> 00:00:29,871
So Odoo shows old status.

6
00:00:30,091 --> 00:00:34,025
Managers walk the floor just to ask where an order is.

7
00:00:34,245 --> 00:00:39,964
And nobody knows how long each operation takes, or how much time is lost to idle.

8
00:00:40,964 --> 00:00:43,049
Meet SKIT AI Vision.

9
00:00:43,269 --> 00:00:50,193
It watches your work stations through your existing cameras, and updates Odoo Manufacturing by itself.

10
00:00:51,193 --> 00:00:57,012
A camera over each work station sees the worker, the fabric, and the tools in their hands.

11
00:00:57,232 --> 00:01:00,352
The AI knows which operation is happening.

12
00:01:00,572 --> 00:01:04,666
Simple rules decide when it starts, and when it ends.

13
00:01:04,886 --> 00:01:08,130
Then Odoo is updated, automatically.

14
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:11,290
Start an order in Odoo.

15
00:01:11,510 --> 00:01:18,579
As the work moves from marking to cutting, stitching, pressing, quality check, and packing,

16
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:24,298
each work order starts and finishes by itself, with real start and end times.

17
00:01:25,298 --> 00:01:27,857
When the last operation is done,

18
00:01:28,077 --> 00:01:31,927
the manufacturing order is marked as done automatically,

19
00:01:32,147 --> 00:01:35,506
so stock is updated and nobody has to click.

20
00:01:36,506 --> 00:01:39,480
The result: no manual entry.

21
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:43,020
A live view of every order and every operation.

22
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:48,239
Real operation times and idle time, to plan and improve with facts.

23
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:52,763
SKIT AI Vision, by Srikesh Infotech.

24
00:01:52,983 --> 00:01:55,842
Your camera, connected to Odoo.

